    "preamble": "Challa Prasad vs The State Of A.P, on 5 August, 2020 Author: Ninala Jayasurya Bench: Ninala Jayasurya Honourable Sri Justice Ninala Jayasurya Criminal Petition No.3029 of 2020 Order:",
    "facts": "This Criminal Petition is filed under Section 482 of the Code of Criminal Procedure, 1973 seeking to quash all further proceedings in Crime No.190 of 2020 on the file of I-Town Police Station, Kavali, SPSR Nellore District. The petitioners are accused Nos.10, 8 and 9 respectively in Crime No.190 of 2020. The said crime has been registered against the petitioners for the alleged offences punishable under Sections 272, 273, 328 of IPC and 59(i) of Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006.",
